{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22450","headline":"南宾郡斋即事寄杨万州 · 白居易","name":"南宾郡斋即事寄杨万州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山上巴子城，山下巴江水。\n中有穷独人，强名爲刺史。\n时时窃自哂，刺史岂如是。\n仓粟餧家人，黄缣裹妻子。\n莓苔翳冠带，雾雨霾楼雉。\n衙鼓暮复朝，郡斋卧还起。\n回头望南浦，亦在烟波里。\n而我复何嗟，夫君犹滞此。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22450.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22450","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}